ue":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"11月14日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"A","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"203cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"120kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130756,"name":"大佛","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/71/f4/130756_crt_nI7i3.jpg","actor_ids":[4895],"name_cn":"大佛","summary":"ORDERの一員。\r\n坂本がORDERを抜けた後に入った新人で、神々廻と共に行動する事が多い。\r\n天然でマイペースな性格で、神々廻をよく困らせている。\r\n食べることと、ゲン担ぎが好き。\r\n華奢な見た目とは裏腹に大きな電ノコを振り回し、ダイナミックに戦う。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":4,"birth_day":9,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"大佛","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"4月9日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"B","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"175cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"55kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"21","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130757,"name":"神々廻","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/fe/83/130757_crt_274S2.jpg","actor_ids":[19713],"name_cn":"神神回","summary":"ORDERの一員、クールで落ち着きのある常識人。\r\n玉ねぎが嫌い。\r\n後輩の大佛とペアで任務にあたることが多く、面倒見も良い。\r\n関西弁で、よく大佛にツッコミを入れている。\r\n使い勝手の良さから、ネイルハンマーを武器にしている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":9,"birth_day":24,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"神神回","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"9月24日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"A","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"180cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"73kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"年龄","value":"26","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130758,"name":"篁","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/d1/4b/130758_crt_0C0o4.jpg","actor_ids":[3879],"name_cn":"篁","summary":"ORDERの一員。\r\n見た目は老人だが、間合いに入るもの全てを日本刀で断ち切る、圧倒的な強さの持ち主。\r\nいつもブツブツとなにかをつぶやいている。\r\nその強さ以外、一切の素性が謎に包まれている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":9,"birth_day":18,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"篁","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"9月18日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"163cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"48kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130759,"name":"京","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/85/db/130759_crt_1iwdT.jpg","actor_ids":[4256],"name_cn":"京","summary":"映画監督でありORDERの一員。\r\n殺し屋映画のパイオニアで、世界中に熱烈なファンがいる。\r\n常にハンディカメラでの撮影に臨み、映画の事だけを考えている映画マニア。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":12,"birth_day":1,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"京","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"12月1日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"B","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"188cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"83kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130761,"name":"有月憬／✕","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/42/5f/130761_crt_jYcl9.jpg","actor_ids":[4254],"name_cn":"有月憬／污点","summary":"腕のある殺し屋を集め、殺し屋殺しを遂行する謎の人物。\r\n現場に✕印を残すことから“スラー”と呼ばれている。\r\n能力や素性、動機などは分かっていない。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":10,"birth_day":14,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"有月憬／污点","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"10月14日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"AB","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"182cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"73kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":130762,"name":"鹿島","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/82/c3/130762_crt_3v3VO.jpg","actor_ids":[5007],"name_cn":"鹿岛","summary":"シンの育ったラボを占拠し、武器開発を主導した。\r\n普段はトナカイの被り物をしており、体中が武器の改造人間。\r\n✕（スラー）を崇拝する忠実な部下で、指示役を任されることも多い。\r\nカラオケでは平成